@startuml
!include ../../_style.puml
title Stored publication flag
left to right direction
state "No module grant" as None
state "revoked = 0" as Granted
state "revoked = 1" as Revoked
[*] --> None
None --> Granted : eligible publish
Granted --> Revoked : revoke
Revoked --> Granted : eligible publish
note bottom of Granted
Rechecked with the current profile, source visibility
and source-access / explicit-publication policy.
end note
@enduml
